#. module: stock_arthome
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:stock_arthome.field_sale_order__delivery_comment
msgid ""
"Dispatch instructions written once in the order. They are copied to its "
"transfers (pick, pack and delivery) and printed on their reports, and copied"
" to the invoice when it is created. Editing them updates only the open "
"transfers."
msgstr ""
"Instrucciones de despacho que se escriben una sola vez en el pedido. Se "
"copian a sus transferencias (recolección, empaque y entrega) y se imprimen "
"en sus reportes, y se copian a la factura al crearla. Editarlas actualiza "
"solo las transferencias abiertas."

